#. y1:english="Take a look,{PA:10} please.\nCheck out the paintings?\n\nAh, {PA:10}if you are interested in something,||let me know.\nThank you very much!{PA:20}||Come by anytime.\nCheck out the other paintings?\n\n\nA raging bull is being drawn.\n\nThe bull always appears in my dreams.{PA:20}||I'll sell it to you for 20,000 yen.\nBuy the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Bull{CR:00}\"?\n\nI'll take it.\nYou bought the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Bull{CR:00}\".\nThank you very much!\n\n\nIt's a painting of a man shouting||desperately from a boat on the lake.\n\nIt depicts the screaming in my heart.{PA:20}||{MS:0}It's neither anger nor sorrow.\nHow about 30,000 yen?\nBuy the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Lake & Man{CR:00}\"?\n\nI'll take it.\nYou bought||the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Lake & Man{CR:00}\".\nThank you very much!\n\n\nA painting of a pumpkin atop of an egg.{PA:10}||What is this painting?\n\nOh, that's my masterpiece. I'm really||reluctant to sell it.{PA:20}\nBut if you want,{PA:10}||I'll sell it to you for 50,000 yen.\nBuy the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Egg & Pumpkin{CR:00}\"?\n\nI'll take it.\nYou bought the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Egg & Pumpkin{CR:00}\".\nThank you very much!\n\n\nIs she reciting a poem or something||while holding an onion in her right hand?\n\nOh, that...{PA:10} That's not that good.{PA:20}||I'll sell it to you for 5,000 yen.\nBuy the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Lady with Onion{CR:00}\"?\n\nI'll take it.\nYou bought||the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Lady with Onion{CR:00}\".\nThank you very much!\n\n\nYou've already purchased that painting.{PA:20}||Take a look at the other ones too.\nYou can't afford it...{PA:10}||Come back some other time.{PA:10}\nI'll be waiting for you."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0050.BIN:79_0_54
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0050.BIN::line:79_0_54"
msgid "Estaré esperándote."
msgstr ""

