#. y1:english="Ah,{PA:10} thank you very much for the other day...{PA:20}\nTo tell you the truth...{PA:10}||I was thinking about giving up painting.\nReally...{PA:20}||That's a shame.\nWell,{PA:10} I was very happy||that you bought my paintings.\nI really appreciate it.\nGive him the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Book by a Struggling Writer{CR:00}\"?\nHere.{PA:10} Someone told me to give this to you.\nWhat's this?{PA:10} A dirty book...{PA:10}||Umm,{PA:10} well,{PA:10} thank you very much.\nI'll read it since||I have all this time on my hands...\nThis is my last painting.{PA:20}||Please keep it.\n\nYou got the \"{CC:ffc8c8}Painting of Cat on Carrot{CR:00}\".\n\nThank you very much...{PA:10} for everything.\nThat painting is a very important treasure||to me.\nKeep it as a memento.\nYou gained 1,000 exp.\n\nShortly thereafter,{PA:10} influenced by the book,{PA:10}||he painted painting after painting.\n5 years later,{PA:10} he moved to France||and became a world famous painter.\n\n"
