#. y1:english="I'm an art dealer.{PA:10} Do you have any idea||where the painter who used to be here\nhas gone?\nNo,{PA:10} I don't.\nI see... That's very unfortunate...\nI had a feeling that you knew something||about him.\nYeah, I know where he is.\nOh, really? And do you have||some of his paintings by any chance?\nShow him something?\n\nThat's...{PA:10} not exactly what I had in mind.\nReally...{PA:10}||That's unfortunate.\n(I have nothing to show him...)\nWell, well, well. {PA:10}{MS:0}What do we have here!{MS:1}{PA:10}||Please sell this to me!\nHow does 130,000 yen sound to you?\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll sell it.\nWell, well, well. {PA:10}{MS:0}What do we have here!{MS:1}{PA:10}||Please sell this to me!\nHow does 130,000 yen sound to you?\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll sell it.\nWell, well, well. {PA:10}{MS:0}What do we have here!{MS:1}{PA:10}||Please sell this to me!\nHow does 130,000 yen sound to you?\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll sell it.\nWell, well, well. {PA:10}{MS:0}What do we have here!{MS:1}{PA:10}||Please sell this to me!\nHow does 130,000 yen sound to you?\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll sell it.\nWell, well, well. {PA:10}{MS:0}What do we have here!{MS:1}{PA:10}||Please sell this to me!\nHow does 130,000 yen sound to you?\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll sell it.\nYes!{PA:10} Here is 130,000 yen.\nYou received 130,000 yen.\nThere is no doubt in my mind that this||painter will become famous in the future!\nI'll find him at any cost and take him||to my atelier in France!\nYou gained 500 exp.\nNo,{PA:10} I won't sell it.\nReally...{PA:10}||That's too bad."
