#. y1:english="How do you do?\nMr. Kazuma Kiryu, I presume.\nThe ex-soldier from the Dojima Family||of the Tojo Clan!\nWhat?{PA:10} Oh,{PA:10} no.{PA:10} That can't be...\nWho...{PA:10} are you?\nI'm honoured to be asked.\nI apologize to you in advance||if my proposal doesn't interest you.\nLet me introduce myself.{PA:10}||I was born in Asakusa of Tokyo.\nMy Oyabun is Kyozo Atobe,{PA:10}||the third boss of the Atobe Family.\nMy name is Ichirota Yoshikawa.\nThey call me Ichi.\nAs you can see,{PA:10} I'm low on the totem pole\nand need to be taken care of by brother||and sisters.\nI hope we will fare well||in business together.\nWho the hell are you anyway?\nOh, come on! I introduced myself already...{PA:20}||And in the traditional way!\nI'm from the Atobe Family.\nThank you very much||for helping our men with Kyoka.\nSo?{PA:10} What does an Atobe man want from me?\nWell,||now that you ask!\nIf I may speak frankly,{PA:10}||we don't think that kid,{PA:10}\nTakashi, has what it takes.\nSo I was sent over here to||watch over him...\nBut I have no idea||where they are. So...\nI'd like you to find both of them with me,||Kazuma-san.\nYou know a lot about this city,{PA:10}\nI would be honoured||if you'd help me find them.\nI don't think so.{PA:20} Ask someone else.\nYou're cold as ice...{PA:10}||In fact,{PA:10} this whole city is cold...\nOkay.\nI knew you would, Kazuma-san.{PA:20}||You have a big heart!\nOkay,{PA:10} if you run into Miss Kyoka,||ask her to give these to the kid.\nYou received a \"{CC:ffc8c8}Pair of Mashiko Teacups{CR:00}\".\nShe'll know what it means||when you give them to her.\nKazuma-san,{PA:10} I'm counting on you."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0050.BIN:91_1_21
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0050.BIN::line:91_1_21"
msgid "Así que me enviaron||para vigilarlo..."
msgstr ""

