#. y1:english="Oh,{PA:20} Kazuma-san.{PA:10} How'd everything go?{PA:20}||Did you find Miss Kyoka?\nGive him \"{CC:ffc8c8}Kyoka's Ring{CR:00}\"?\nYou gave him \"{CC:ffc8c8}Kyoka's Ring{CR:00}\".\nCould this be?!||It is. It's Miss Kyoka's ring.\nThis means,{PA:10}||you gave her the pair of teacups, right?\nI'm very happy!||So,{PA:10} where are they now?\nThey left the city.\nThey promised that they would come back||to Atobe Oyabun to get the ring back.\n...I see.{PA:10}||Miss Kyoka made a good arrangement...\nThank you very much,{PA:10} Kazuma-san.{PA:20}||I will tell the Oyabun,{PA:10} in person.\nI'm sorry for all the trouble, Kazuma-san...\nThis is the token of the gratitude from the||Atobe Family. Please take it.\nYou received 100,000 yen.\nYou gained 500 exp.\nHehe...{PA:10} This city is filled with more||compassion than I thought.\nI'll be going now.{PA:10}||Kazuma-san, thank you very much.\nI'll be going now.{PA:10} Kazuma-san,{PA:20}||thank you very much.\nHuh?{PA:10} You haven't found them yet...?{PA:20}\nSorry,{PA:10} but please keep looking for||them until you find them."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0050.BIN:91_4_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0050.BIN::line:91_4_0"
msgid "Oh,{PA:20} Kazuma-san.{PA:10} ¿Cómo ha ido todo?{PA:20}||¿Has encontrado a la Señorita Kyoka?"
msgstr ""

